{"id":"torrey:wives","source":"torrey","name":"Wives","slug":"wives","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Not to be selected from among the ungodly — Ge 24:3; 26:34,35; 28:1.","refs":[["Gen",24,3,24,3],["Gen",26,34,26,34],["Gen",26,35,26,35],["Gen",28,1,28,1]]},{"text":"To love them. — Tit 2:4.","refs":[["Titus",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"To reverence them. — Eph 5:33.","refs":[["Eph",5,33,5,33]]},{"text":"To be faithful to them. — 1Co 7:3-5,10.","refs":[["1Cor",7,3,7,5],["1Cor",7,10,7,10]]},{"text":"To be subject to them. — Ge 3:16; Eph 5:22,24; 1Pe 3:1.","refs":[["Gen",3,16,3,16],["Eph",5,22,5,22],["Eph",5,24,5,24],["1Pet",3,1,3,1]]},{"text":"To obey them. — 1Co 14:34; Tit 2:5.","refs":[["1Cor",14,34,14,34],["Titus",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"To remain with them for life. — Ro 7:2,3.","refs":[["Rom",7,2,7,2],["Rom",7,3,7,3]]},{"text":"Not with ornaments. — 1Ti 2:9; 1Pe 3:3.","refs":[["1Tim",2,9,2,9],["1Pet",3,3,3,3]]},{"text":"With modesty and sobriety. — 1Ti 2:9.","refs":[["1Tim",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"With a meek and quiet spirit. — 1Pe 3:4,5.","refs":[["1Pet",3,4,3,4],["1Pet",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"With good works. — 1Ti 2:10; 5:10.","refs":[["1Tim",2,10,2,10],["1Tim",5,10,5,10]]},{"text":"Are from the Lord. — Pr 19:14.","refs":[["Prov",19,14,19,14]]},{"text":"Are a token of the favour of God. — Pr 18:22.","refs":[["Prov",18,22,18,22]]},{"text":"Are a blessing to husbands. — Pr 12:4; 31:10,12.","refs":[["Prov",12,4,12,4],["Prov",31,10,31,10],["Prov",31,12,31,12]]},{"text":"Bring honour on husbands. — Pr 31:23.","refs":[["Prov",31,23,31,23]]},{"text":"Secure confidence of husbands. — Pr 31:11.","refs":[["Prov",31,11,31,11]]},{"text":"Are praised by husbands. — Pr 31:28.","refs":[["Prov",31,28,31,28]]},{"text":"Are diligent and prudent. — Pr 31:13-27.","refs":[["Prov",31,13,31,27]]},{"text":"Are benevolent to the poor. — Pr 31:20.","refs":[["Prov",31,20,31,20]]},{"text":"Duty of, to unbelieving husbands. — 1Co 7:13,14,16; 1Pe 3:1,2.","refs":[["1Cor",7,13,7,13],["1Cor",7,14,7,14],["1Cor"